<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">NOTIFICATION CENTER</view><view class="row align-start"><view><view class="page-title">重要进展，不遗漏</view><view class="sub">{{unread}} 条未读通知</view></view></view><view class="row top-gap"><text class="small-copy">预约结果与逾期提醒</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="markAll" disabled="{{busy || !unread}}">全部已读</button></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card message {{item.unread ? 'unread' : ''}}" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><text class="chip {{item.unread ? 'green' : 'muted'}}">{{item.unread ? '未读' : '已读'}}</text><text class="small-copy">{{item.time_label}}</text></view><view class="message-text">{{item.content}}</view><view class="message-meta" wx:if="{{item.booking_id}}">查看相关预约　↗</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在更新通知…</view><view wx:if="{{!loading && items.length === 0}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">暂时没有新消息</view>预约确认与状态变化会在这里留下记录。</view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="text-button top-gap" bindtap="more" disabled="{{loading}}">加载更多</button><view class="hint top-gap">这里展示系统内通知；当前演示不接入微信订阅消息。</view></view>
